        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sooni Taraporevala, Mira Nair, Denzel Washington, Sarita Choudhury, Roshan Seth\n- Films: Salaam Bombay, Mississippi Masala, The Namesake, Little Zizou\n\nFacts:\n- Sooni Taraporevala was born in 1957 and is an Indian screenwriter, photographer, and filmmaker.\n- Salaam Bombay was released in 1988, was directed by Mira Nair, and had a screenplay by Sooni Taraporevala.\n- Salaam Bombay was nominated for an Academy Award.\n- Mississippi Masala is a 1991 romantic drama film directed by Mira Nair and based on a screenplay by Sooni Taraporevala.\n- Mississippi Masala stars Denzel Washington, Sarita Choudhury, and Roshan Seth.\n- Sooni Taraporevala is best known as the screenwriter of Mississippi Masala, The Namesake, and Salaam Bombay.\n- Little Zizou is a 2008 Indian film in Hindi, Gujarati, and English that was written and directed by Sooni Taraporevala.",
